Combine the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\,\\,\\,449,\\!337,\\!234 \\\\\n   +\\,757,\\!267,\\!817 \\\\\n   \\hline\n    1,\\!206,\\!605,\\!051 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{1,\\!206,\\!605,\\!051}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is"]]
