 the ten millions place:**\n   \\[\n   3 + 6 + 1 \\text{ (carry)} = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 0 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n   \\]\n   \n9. **Add the hundred millions place:**\n   \\[\n   3 + 6 + 1 \\text{ (carry)} = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 0 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n   \\]\n   \n10. **Add the billions place:**\n    \\[\n    0 + 0 + 1 \\text{ (carry)} = 1\n    \\]\n    \nCombining all the results, we get:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!002,\\!183,\\!083}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is"]]
