ults:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\,\\,\\,405,\\!781,\\!934 \\\\\n   + \\,\\,259,\\!354,\\!502 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     \\,\\,\\,665,\\!136,\\!436 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{665,\\!136,\\!436}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is"]]
