e:**  \n     \\(8 + 7 = 15\\)  \n     Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n   \n   - **Ten millions place:**  \n     \\(3 + 0 + 1 = 4\\)  \n     Write down **4**.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\phantom{0}39,\\!809,\\!354,\\!6 \\\\\n   +\\phantom{0}78,\\!239,\\!8314 \\\\\n   \\hline\n   118,\\!049,\\!1860 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{118,\\!049,\\!1860}\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is"]]
